{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgiaSYhHR3os3TGwf2TfF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```python\nimport json, numpy as np\nfrom collections import deque\nG = json.load(open('/work/pass_12/games.json'))\nB = np.load('/work/pass_12/boards.npy')\ndef nb(i):\n    r,c=divmod(i,9); return [(r+dr)*9+c+dc for dr,dc in ((-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)) if 0<=r+dr<9 and 0<=c+dc<9]\ndef analyze(board, s):\n    col = board[s]\n    dist = {s:0}; dq = deque([s])\n    while dq:\n        u = dq.popleft()\n        for v in nb(u):\n            if board[v]==col and v not in dist: dist[v]=dist[u]+1; dq.append(v)\n    libs = {}\n    for u,dd in dist.items():\n        for v in nb(u):\n            if board[v]==0: libs[v] = min(libs.get(v,99), dd)\n    return len(dist), sorted(libs.values())\nfor gi_, ply, s in [(91, 78, 17), (19, 77, 2), (66, 86, 46)]:\n    print(gi_, ply, divmod(s,9), analyze(B[gi_, ply], s))\n# general stats: in pass 12 games, how often a chain adjacent to an empty point has its nearest 2nd liberty beyond 6+8 hops\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2823,"cache_read_input_tokens":432982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2823},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75fe5168-548a-4409-9122-1a4e4ad26e69","uuid":"b06886d2-c260-4c2f-b464-67a867d2a4dd","timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:12:55.064Z","request_id":"req_011CgiaSYLwU3kfkUqFyzA7d"}
